  "fabric": {
    "capacityMbps": 176000,
    "kind": "switching fabric",
    "note": "ECS4120 Series datasheet R16 (EC-DS-0324-R16, 2024-03-12) prints 176 Gbps switching capacity and 130 Mpps forwarding rate: 48x 1G + 4x 10G = 88 Gbps of port rate, so the quoted figure is the full-duplex aggregate. https://www.edge-core.com/download/ecs4120-series-ds-r16/?wpdmdl=1696"
  },
  "notes": "Port census from ECS4120 Series datasheet R16 (EC-DS-0324-R16, 2024-03-12) (https://www.edge-core.com/download/ecs4120-series-ds-r16/?wpdmdl=1696): RJ-45 10/100/1000BASE-T 48, SFP+ 10 Gigabit uplink 4, GE out-of-band management port No, RJ-45 console port 1. The SFP+ cages take 1G or 10G modules, hence speedCaps [1000, 10000]. Flash 256 MB, DRAM 512 MB, MAC table 16 K, jumbo 9 KB, max system power 60 W, 100-240 VAC, 44 x 27.9 x 4.4 cm, 3.72 kg. No PoE. Same L2+/L3 Lite feature set as the rest of the series: static routes, RIP v1/v2, DHCP server with 8 pools / 512 addresses. Edgecore publishes no /product/ecs4120-52t/ page (HTTP 404 on 2026-11-16), so the series datasheet is the only vendor source for this member. Software ECS4120 FW V1.2.2.30, posted with the ECS4120 series R16 datasheet on the product download list. CLI reference: https://www.edge-core.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ECS4120-Series_CLI-R06_20251014.pdf."
}
